msgid "Dash to Dock Visibility"
msgstr "仪表盘到停靠可见性"

#: src/prefs.js:204
msgid "How to display dash-to-dock when the switcher is active."
msgstr "当切换器处于活动状态时，如何显示 Dash-to-Dock。"

